¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙrAnd she shall bring forth a son, and thou shalt call his name JESUS: for he shall save his people from their sins.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book'§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙfNow all this was done, that it might be fulfilled which was spoken of the Lord by the prophet, saying,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÃ¥lines“‚¤textÙBBehold, a virgin shall be with child, and shall bring forth a son,¦layout ‚¤textÙ&And they shall call his name Emmanuel,¦layout§quote_1‚¤textÙ(which being interpreted is, God with us.¦layout­mid_paragraphªlast_verse…¤book'§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙlThen Joseph being raised from sleep did as the angel of the Lord had bidden him, and took unto him his wife:¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ\and knew her not till she had brought forth her firstborn son: and he called his name JESUS.¦layout ªlast_verse